</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"></td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b7ed37db-82c3-6a70-a7ef-679d92b026bf" id="_b7ed37db-82c3-6a70-a7ef-679d92b026bf"></a>1: prohibited<br/> 2: not recommended<br/> 3: permitted<br/> 4: recommended<br/> 5: required<br/> 6: not required</p>
