</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0e9f4e12-734d-4219-5b1b-6ffab1f90c95" id="_0e9f4e12-734d-4219-5b1b-6ffab1f90c95"></a>Permission</p>
</td><td colspan="2" valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c3320f88-70b7-4c36-e63b-80a99d5a5339" id="_c3320f88-70b7-4c36-e63b-80a99d5a5339"></a><b>Applicability</b></p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_312d61c6-60b8-c35c-705b-280b2559461f" id="_312d61c6-60b8-c35c-705b-280b2559461f"></a>1, 1</p>
