<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_efa358e0-5967-4ff9-d181-ba3df87194ac" id="_efa358e0-5967-4ff9-d181-ba3df87194ac"></a><b>Subject Indicator Character</b> (see <a href="#sec_12.97">Clause 12.97</a>)</p>

<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4c2229e4-c579-b393-dbc0-29c4c91969da" id="_4c2229e4-c579-b393-dbc0-29c4c91969da"></a><b>Subject Description</b> (see <a href="#sec_12.96">Clause 12.96</a>)</p>

