<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ac65ec9d-8c57-f0e7-ebc9-d0b35d9c3455" id="_ac65ec9d-8c57-f0e7-ebc9-d0b35d9c3455"></a><b>City Name</b> (see <a href="#sec_12.28">Clause 12.28</a>)</p>

<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_be200406-5b31-f598-59dd-fa784bebdb5a" id="_be200406-5b31-f598-59dd-fa784bebdb5a"></a><b>Administrative Division</b> (see <a href="#sec_12.3">Clause 12.3</a>)</p>

