        <div><a name="sec_13.5" id="sec_13.5"></a><h2>13.5<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Coverage Indication</h2>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_308a93a5-36bc-f037-fc73-b8f12d611b32" id="_308a93a5-36bc-f037-fc73-b8f12d611b32"></a><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_60d7c4d6-343a-97a2-595e-f5a4983176c2" id="_60d7c4d6-343a-97a2-595e-f5a4983176c2"></a><u>IHO Definition:</u> Details related to the indication of the radio coverage.</p>

<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_afb1a537-6816-f646-fc2e-7dc029b6dd58" id="_afb1a537-6816-f646-fc2e-7dc029b6dd58"></a><u>Sub-attributes:</u></p>

