<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b5e96cc8-f9ef-f416-a2a5-ac208816ce1f" id="_b5e96cc8-f9ef-f416-a2a5-ac208816ce1f"></a><b>Minimum Signal to Interference Noise Ratio</b> (see <a href="#sec_12.65">Clause 12.65</a>)</p>

