</div>
        <div><a name="sec_13.6" id="sec_13.6"></a><h2>13.6<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Feature Name</h2>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_79fd47ed-11bd-1db7-8ae6-e132e69cbe35" id="_79fd47ed-11bd-1db7-8ae6-e132e69cbe35"></a><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_82fa9ed1-c11b-ca4f-c6d8-9d3670ebdc7e" id="_82fa9ed1-c11b-ca4f-c6d8-9d3670ebdc7e"></a><u>IHO Definition:</u> Provides the name of an entity, defines the national language of the name, and provides the option to display the name at various system display settings.</p>

<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2ed96252-a7a3-f7a8-c83f-d01c4edab3f6" id="_2ed96252-a7a3-f7a8-c83f-d01c4edab3f6"></a><u>Sub-attributes:</u></p>

