  <p class="MsoFootnoteText"><a name="_d30a20c1-b470-0684-b260-0ed1eb507a12" id="_d30a20c1-b470-0684-b260-0ed1eb507a12"></a><a style="mso-footnote-id:ftn1" href="#_ftn1" name="_ftnref1" title="" id="_ftnref1"><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="mso-special-character:footnote"></span></span></a>S-100 and by extension S-131 have not adopted ISO 8601-1/2 (2019).</p>
